# The bundled core and geodata are produced by `tools/fetch-kernel.mjs` and
# `tools/fetch-geodata.mjs`. They ARE committed on purpose: shipping them is the
# whole point of the plugin, so a fresh install needs no download at all.
# Uncomment the two lines below only if you would rather keep the repository
# small and run the fetchers yourself.
#
# bin/mihomo-windows-amd64-compatible.exe
# bin/geoip.metadb
# bin/geosite.dat

# Debugging and local-acceptance scripts. They hard-code paths on the machine
# they were written for, so they are development scaffolding rather than part of
# the plugin. `tools/fetch-kernel.mjs`, `tools/fetch-geodata.mjs` and
# `tools/verify-setup.mjs` are portable and are committed.
tools/acceptance.mjs
tools/verify-workflow.mjs
tools/verify-selection.mjs
tools/verify-failover.mjs
tools/verify-independence.mjs
tools/bootstrap-test.mjs
tools/test-harness.mjs
tools/probe-routing.mjs

node_modules/
*.log
